    "name": "Placid Plastic Deck - A Quiet Quest",
    "steam_appid": 2510020,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN THE CHAT</h1><p></p><br><h1>Feature List</h1><p>- A blend of 2D and 3D graphics<br>- Themed decks and boards, each with its own personality<br>- Multiple-choice, branching dialogues<br>- Memorable and peculiar characters<br>- A heartfelt, story-rich adventure</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/862672a24be38816a9e81fb4fa1e428d.poster.avif?t=1753355087\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/862672a24be38816a9e81fb4fa1e428d.webm?t=1753355087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/862672a24be38816a9e81fb4fa1e428d.mp4?t=1753355087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second game from the creators of Placid Plastic Duck Simulator!<br><br>What started as a mundane trip to another neighborhood has turned into a journey across land, sea, and air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Zoi, a teenage girl on a mission to make it up to her best friend. To do that, you\u2019ll have to enter the regional card tournament and win the grand prize!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only problem is\u2026 well, you\u2019re not very good at cards. Or rather, you\u2019re really bad. Actually, you don\u2019t even know the rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, you are determined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fueled by the power of friendship, you'll explore exotic locations, meet memorable characters, play the card game, and challenge pro players to move forward\u2026 armed only with a deck of ducks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/ede68f4725a188debfd8ee70e95f5a04.poster.avif?t=1753355087\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/ede68f4725a188debfd8ee70e95f5a04.webm?t=1753355087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/ede68f4725a188debfd8ee70e95f5a04.mp4?t=1753355087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe of Placid Plastic Duck Simulator is expanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ducks are going on an adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join them.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/862672a24be38816a9e81fb4fa1e428d.poster.avif?t=1753355087\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/862672a24be38816a9e81fb4fa1e428d.webm?t=1753355087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/862672a24be38816a9e81fb4fa1e428d.mp4?t=1753355087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second game from the creators of Placid Plastic Duck Simulator!<br><br>What started as a mundane trip to another neighborhood has turned into a journey across land, sea, and air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Zoi, a teenage girl on a mission to make it up to her best friend. To do that, you\u2019ll have to enter the regional card tournament and win the grand prize!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only problem is\u2026 well, you\u2019re not very good at cards. Or rather, you\u2019re really bad. Actually, you don\u2019t even know the rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, you are determined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fueled by the power of friendship, you'll explore exotic locations, meet memorable characters, play the card game, and challenge pro players to move forward\u2026 armed only with a deck of ducks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/ede68f4725a188debfd8ee70e95f5a04.poster.avif?t=1753355087\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/ede68f4725a188debfd8ee70e95f5a04.webm?t=1753355087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/ede68f4725a188debfd8ee70e95f5a04.mp4?t=1753355087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe of Placid Plastic Duck Simulator is expanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ducks are going on an adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join them.</p>",
    "short_description": "A story-driven adventure featuring multiple-choice dialogue, card battles, and peculiar characters! A friendship to mend, and a cast of opponents to beat, each with a uniquely built deck. But you're in luck\u2026 yours is all ducks!",
